MIT License. It uses ExtendedAE Plus (GaLicn/ExtendedAE_Plus) as a separately
installed runtime dependency.

RegistryBigIntegerTestCellItem and ConfiguredBigIntegerTestCellItem subclass
ExtendedAE Plus' InfinityBigIntegerCellItem and use its BigInteger storage API.
The cell item models reference the upstream parent model
extendedae_plus:item/infinity_biginteger_cell. No ExtendedAE Plus Java code,
source, model JSON, or texture PNG is bundled in this JAR.

